WEBVTT

1
00:01:17.019 --> 00:01:21.386
<font color="#FFFFFF">When is a door not a door?</font>

2
00:01:21.419 --> 00:01:22.751
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sorry?</font>

3
00:01:22.818 --> 00:01:26.385
<font color="#FFFFFF">When is a door not a door?</font>

4
00:01:29.085 --> 00:01:30.718
<font color="#FFFFFF">She doesn't understand.</font>

5
00:01:30.785 --> 00:01:32.950
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. it's a riddle.</font>

6
00:01:33.017 --> 00:01:34.451
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think she understands
perfectly.</font>

7
00:01:34.518 --> 00:01:37.450
<font color="#FFFFFF">So I'll ask one more time.</font>

8
00:01:37.517 --> 00:01:41.383
<font color="#FFFFFF">When is a door not a door?</font>

9
00:01:41.384 --> 00:01:42.917
<font color="#FFFFFF">When it's "ajar."</font>

10
00:01:42.983 --> 00:01:46.383
<font color="#FFFFFF">Like one of those.</font>

11
00:01:46.384 --> 00:01:49.382
<font color="#FFFFFF">The jar I'm looking for
has a special symbol on it.</font>

12
00:01:49.383 --> 00:01:53.016
<font color="#FFFFFF">a triskelion.
three spirals connected.</font>

13
00:01:53.082 --> 00:01:55.683
<font color="#FFFFFF">We don't know what
you're talking about.</font>

14
00:01:55.749 --> 00:01:57.115
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe you should leave.</font>

15
00:01:57.182 --> 00:01:59.148
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh.</font>

16
00:01:59.215 --> 00:02:02.482
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a very special jar.
actually.</font>

17
00:02:02.548 --> 00:02:04.748
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was made from the wood
of a sacred tree</font>

18
00:02:04.815 --> 00:02:08.814
<font color="#FFFFFF">and used to capture
a dark Kitsune...</font>

19
00:02:08.881 --> 00:02:12.047
<font color="#FFFFFF">A trickster spirit
called Nogitsune.</font>

20
00:02:12.114 --> 00:02:15.581
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. all these jars
contain are teas and spices.</font>

21
00:02:15.647 --> 00:02:17.547
<font color="#FFFFFF">So whatever it is you
came here looking for...</font>

22
00:02:17.614 --> 00:02:20.381
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know exactly what I came
here looking for. Mr. Dunbar.</font>

23
00:02:30.012 --> 00:02:32.380
<font color="#FFFFFF">You all do.</font>

24
00:03:07.377 --> 00:03:08.377
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hikari!</font>

25
00:03:17.841 --> 00:03:19.041
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!</font>

26
00:03:22.475 --> 00:03:23.508
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!</font>

27
00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.675
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't know
what you're doing!</font>

28
00:03:27.741 --> 00:03:31.674
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've been searching
for this for years.</font>

29
00:03:31.740 --> 00:03:34.107
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know precisely what I'm doing.</font>

30
00:03:34.174 --> 00:03:36.440
<font color="#FFFFFF">You can't control it.</font>

31
00:03:36.507 --> 00:03:37.507
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't want to.</font>

32
00:03:47.639 --> 00:03:50.938
<font color="#FFFFFF">Set me free.</font>

33
00:03:51.005 --> 00:03:52.805
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not until you make me a promise.</font>

34
00:03:52.872 --> 00:03:56.705
<font color="#FFFFFF">What fool would ask a promise
from a trickster spirit?</font>

35
00:03:56.772 --> 00:03:59.271
<font color="#FFFFFF">Call it a mutually
beneficial arrangement.</font>

36
00:03:59.372 --> 00:04:02.371
<font color="#FFFFFF">If you're as all powerful and
omniscient as they say.</font>

37
00:04:02.372 --> 00:04:04.804
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then you already know
what I want.</font>

38
00:04:04.871 --> 00:04:08.437
<font color="#FFFFFF">You want retribution</font>

39
00:04:08.504 --> 00:04:11.504
<font color="#FFFFFF">against him.</font>

40
00:04:11.571 --> 00:04:14.836
<font color="#FFFFFF">his friends.</font>

41
00:04:14.903 --> 00:04:18.970
<font color="#FFFFFF">and everyone he loves.</font>

42
00:04:19.036 --> 00:04:22.169
<font color="#FFFFFF">Set me free</font>

43
00:04:22.235 --> 00:04:26.403
<font color="#FFFFFF">and we'll play a new game.</font>

44
00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:28.369
<font color="#FFFFFF">a game of chaos.</font>

45
00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:30.802
<font color="#FFFFFF">strife.</font>

46
00:04:30.869 --> 00:04:34.102
<font color="#FFFFFF">and pain!</font>

47
00:04:58.667 --> 00:04:59.776
<font color="#FFFFFF">You said it wouldn't bite.</font>

48
00:04:59.800 --> 00:05:01.533
<font color="#FFFFFF">I said it wouldn't bite me.</font>

49
00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.032
<font color="#FFFFFF">But that's also
because I wouldn't</font>

50
00:05:03.099 --> 00:05:07.032
<font color="#FFFFFF">put my hand in front of
the mouth of a frightened dog.</font>

51
00:05:07.099 --> 00:05:08.599
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thanks for the advice.</font>

52
00:05:08.666 --> 00:05:10.241
<font color="#FFFFFF">You got any idea how we're going
to get it out of there?</font>

53
00:05:10.265 --> 00:05:12.141
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have someone coming
who has a special talent</font>

54
00:05:12.165 --> 00:05:13.432
<font color="#FFFFFF">for these kinds of things.</font>

55
00:05:13.499 --> 00:05:15.265
<font color="#FFFFFF">He runs the animal shelter
next to my clinic.</font>

56
00:05:15.366 --> 00:05:18.365
<font color="#FFFFFF">Trust me. he's highly qualified.</font>

57
00:05:18.431 --> 00:05:19.831
<font color="#FFFFFF">We even have a nickname for him.</font>

58
00:05:19.898 --> 00:05:21.365
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh yeah? What?</font>

59
00:05:21.431 --> 00:05:24.064
<font color="#FFFFFF">We call him "The Alpha."</font>

60
00:05:41.396 --> 00:05:42.663
<font color="#FFFFFF">The girl climbed out.</font>

61
00:05:42.729 --> 00:05:44.171
<font color="#FFFFFF">tried to pull it out.
lost her footing.</font>

62
00:05:44.195 --> 00:05:47.629
<font color="#FFFFFF">and ended up falling in too.</font>

63
00:05:47.696 --> 00:05:48.728
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is that all you got?</font>

64
00:05:48.795 --> 00:05:50.062
<font color="#FFFFFF">No protective gear?
No gloves?</font>

65
00:05:50.128 --> 00:05:51.428
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't get bit.</font>

66
00:05:51.495 --> 00:05:53.962
<font color="#FFFFFF">Even if I did. I usually
heal pretty fast.</font>

67
00:05:54.028 --> 00:05:57.094
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. even so...</font>

68
00:05:58.194 --> 00:05:59.662
<font color="#FFFFFF">No! He's gonna bite!</font>

69
00:06:00.827 --> 00:06:01.994
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey there.</font>

70
00:06:02.061 --> 00:06:03.362
<font color="#FFFFFF">My name is Scott.</font>

71
00:06:03.394 --> 00:06:05.074
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to help
get you guys out of here.</font>

72
00:06:29.092 --> 00:06:30.592
<font color="#FFFFFF">Scott. hurry! Come on!</font>

73
00:06:30.659 --> 00:06:31.659
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get out of there!</font>

74
00:06:42.358 --> 00:06:43.558
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right. climb onto me.</font>

75
00:06:43.624 --> 00:06:44.790
<font color="#FFFFFF">Climb onto me.</font>

76
00:06:57.956 --> 00:06:59.856
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on. Alicia.</font>

77
00:06:59.922 --> 00:07:01.122
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got you.</font>

78
00:07:19.388 --> 00:07:21.954
<font color="#FFFFFF">That was close.</font>

79
00:07:23.987 --> 00:07:25.387
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey. Alicia? You guys?</font>

80
00:07:25.454 --> 00:07:30.487
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's go see the paramedics. OK?</font>

81
00:07:30.554 --> 00:07:32.353
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you guys call him again?</font>

82
00:07:32.354 --> 00:07:33.986
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Alpha.</font>

83
00:07:34.053 --> 00:07:36.219
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right. like a dog.</font>

84
00:07:36.353 --> 00:07:39.152
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. like a wolf.</font>

85
00:08:48.847 --> 00:08:51.112
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good boy.</font>

86
00:08:51.179 --> 00:08:53.179
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK. Come here. buddy.</font>

87
00:08:58.012 --> 00:09:00.046
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you know why
Cooper bit the lieutenant?</font>

88
00:09:00.111 --> 00:09:01.346
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because he was scared?</font>

89
00:09:01.379 --> 00:09:02.845
<font color="#FFFFFF">He was scared for you.</font>

90
00:09:02.911 --> 00:09:06.878
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's one of the best parts
about dogs. they fight for us.</font>

91
00:09:06.945 --> 00:09:10.178
<font color="#FFFFFF">Remember. the same way that we
see them as part of our family.</font>

92
00:09:10.244 --> 00:09:11.711
<font color="#FFFFFF">they see us
as part of their pack.</font>

93
00:09:24.109 --> 00:09:25.510
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's still time.</font>

94
00:09:28.109 --> 00:09:29.943
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. I know.</font>

95
00:09:30.009 --> 00:09:31.743
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. I'll have kids
one of these days.</font>

96
00:09:31.809 --> 00:09:35.809
<font color="#FFFFFF">after I find someone.
or someone finds me. I guess.</font>

97
00:09:35.876 --> 00:09:40.608
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. I meant there's still
time to beat traffic.</font>

98
00:09:40.675 --> 00:09:45.408
<font color="#FFFFFF">But if you want to talk.
there's still time for that too.</font>

99
00:09:45.475 --> 00:09:49.774
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think I was just.
maybe feeling kind of. uh...</font>

100
00:09:49.841 --> 00:09:51.342
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wistful.</font>

101
00:09:53.342 --> 00:09:56.874
<font color="#FFFFFF">It means a kind of
longing or regret.</font>

102
00:09:56.941 --> 00:09:59.341
<font color="#FFFFFF">a sort of melancholy
about the past</font>

103
00:09:59.407 --> 00:10:01.374
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the choices we've made.</font>

104
00:10:04.106 --> 00:10:06.273
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wistful.</font>

105
00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:08.740
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why don't you lock up?
I'll get my stuff.</font>

106
00:10:25.804 --> 00:10:27.204
<font color="#FFFFFF">I didn't see him.</font>

107
00:10:27.271 --> 00:10:29.271
<font color="#FFFFFF">I took my eyes off the road
for. like. two seconds!</font>

108
00:10:29.305 --> 00:10:30.438
<font color="#FFFFFF">Quiet!</font>

109
00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:18.967
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh! Jesus!</font>

110
00:11:22.833 --> 00:11:24.033
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey.</font>

111
00:11:25.533 --> 00:11:27.533
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shit. dude.</font>

112
00:11:27.599 --> 00:11:29.309
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know you could just
use the front door. right?</font>

113
00:11:29.333 --> 00:11:33.533
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never use the front door.</font>

114
00:11:33.599 --> 00:11:35.466
<font color="#FFFFFF">Especially when it's not safe.</font>

115
00:11:35.533 --> 00:11:37.598
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who says it's not safe?</font>

116
00:11:42.964 --> 00:11:44.632
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're seeing her too.</font>

117
00:11:46.332 --> 00:11:48.332
<font color="#FFFFFF">I mean. I've dreamt about her.</font>

118
00:11:48.365 --> 00:11:49.931
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know. now and then
over the years</font>

119
00:11:49.997 --> 00:11:54.996
<font color="#FFFFFF">I've had images flicker in front
of my eyes like blurry photos.</font>

120
00:11:55.063 --> 00:11:59.330
<font color="#FFFFFF">And then. two weeks ago.
something changed.</font>

121
00:11:59.331 --> 00:12:02.430
<font color="#FFFFFF">Those random images</font>

122
00:12:02.496 --> 00:12:05.596
<font color="#FFFFFF">flickering through
my head got clearer.</font>

123
00:12:05.663 --> 00:12:08.496
<font color="#FFFFFF">I saw flashes of her crying out.</font>

124
00:12:08.563 --> 00:12:10.329
<font color="#FFFFFF">silently screaming in pain.</font>

125
00:12:10.330 --> 00:12:11.330
<font color="#FFFFFF">in agony.</font>

126
00:12:11.396 --> 00:12:13.762
<font color="#FFFFFF">She was suffering.</font>

127
00:12:13.829 --> 00:12:16.094
<font color="#FFFFFF">Allison.</font>

128
00:12:16.161 --> 00:12:20.329
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I started seeing her face
more and more.</font>

129
00:12:20.362 --> 00:12:23.429
<font color="#FFFFFF">And then I started
hearing her voice.</font>

130
00:12:23.494 --> 00:12:27.327
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I can hear somebody
whispering to me.</font>

131
00:12:27.328 --> 00:12:28.328
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whispering what?</font>

132
00:12:28.329 --> 00:12:31.328
<font color="#FFFFFF">One word. and only one.</font>

133
00:12:31.361 --> 00:12:33.569
<font color="#FFFFFF">I hear it every time I go to
sleep and every time I wake up.</font>

134
00:12:33.593 --> 00:12:36.127
<font color="#FFFFFF">and I only wake up
from nightmares.</font>

135
00:12:36.193 --> 00:12:37.193
<font color="#FFFFFF">What word?</font>

136
00:12:40.159 --> 00:12:41.360
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bardo.</font>

137
00:12:46.327 --> 00:12:49.792
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh. I... I. uh...</font>

138
00:12:49.859 --> 00:12:51.302
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was on the phone the other day
and I was writing down</font>

139
00:12:51.326 --> 00:12:52.526
<font color="#FFFFFF">a client's number.</font>

140
00:12:52.592 --> 00:12:55.492
<font color="#FFFFFF">But instead of the number.
I wrote that.</font>

141
00:12:59.925 --> 00:13:02.325
<font color="#FFFFFF">Scott. do you know
what bardo is?</font>

142
00:13:02.391 --> 00:13:03.858
<font color="#FFFFFF">A state between life and death.</font>

143
00:13:03.925 --> 00:13:05.066
<font color="#FFFFFF">You and I.
we're both seeing her.</font>

144
00:13:05.090 --> 00:13:07.090
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're both speaking
the same word.</font>

145
00:13:07.157 --> 00:13:08.325
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not just a dream.</font>

146
00:13:08.391 --> 00:13:10.424
<font color="#FFFFFF">Allison is caught between
life and death.</font>

147
00:13:10.490 --> 00:13:12.524
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not that simple.</font>

148
00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:13.890
<font color="#FFFFFF">Bardo is a Tibetan word.</font>

149
00:13:13.957 --> 00:13:15.424
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a means of
interpreting death</font>

150
00:13:15.490 --> 00:13:16.856
<font color="#FFFFFF">and the movements
of consciousness</font>

151
00:13:16.923 --> 00:13:19.189
<font color="#FFFFFF">between physical states
of being.</font>

152
00:13:19.324 --> 00:13:21.456
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's just a word.</font>

153
00:13:21.523 --> 00:13:22.789
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a concept.</font>

154
00:13:22.856 --> 00:13:24.499
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. that fucking concept
is waking me up</font>

155
00:13:24.523 --> 00:13:26.064
<font color="#FFFFFF">in the middle of the night
in a cold sweat.</font>

156
00:13:26.088 --> 00:13:29.955
<font color="#FFFFFF">telling me my daughter
is still out there!</font>

157
00:13:30.022 --> 00:13:31.489
<font color="#FFFFFF">She can't be.</font>

158
00:13:31.555 --> 00:13:34.488
<font color="#FFFFFF">I mean. she...
She died in my arms.</font>

159
00:13:34.555 --> 00:13:37.087
<font color="#FFFFFF">I felt her slip away from me.</font>

160
00:13:37.154 --> 00:13:38.422
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know we all die.</font>

161
00:13:38.488 --> 00:13:41.655
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm not pretending to know
what happens next.</font>

162
00:13:41.721 --> 00:13:44.654
<font color="#FFFFFF">But if there was something
after this life. some next step.</font>

163
00:13:44.721 --> 00:13:46.321
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't think she made it.</font>

164
00:13:46.387 --> 00:13:49.953
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I think she's trying to
tell us she never crossed over.</font>

165
00:13:51.387 --> 00:13:53.886
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's been 15 years.</font>

166
00:13:53.953 --> 00:13:57.320
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's say we accept all this.</font>

167
00:13:57.353 --> 00:13:59.453
<font color="#FFFFFF">What can we actually do to help?</font>

168
00:13:59.520 --> 00:14:02.420
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's a... a...
A ritual of some kind.</font>

169
00:14:02.486 --> 00:14:04.185
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know a few details.</font>

170
00:14:04.320 --> 00:14:07.019
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got a feeling the real answers
are in Beacon Hills.</font>

171
00:14:10.319 --> 00:14:11.452
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK.</font>

172
00:14:11.519 --> 00:14:13.752
<font color="#FFFFFF">What else can you say
for certain?</font>

173
00:14:13.819 --> 00:14:15.951
<font color="#FFFFFF">It has to be done by
the next full moon.</font>

174
00:14:16.018 --> 00:14:18.884
<font color="#FFFFFF">And if it's not.
we don't get another chance.</font>

175
00:14:20.384 --> 00:14:21.618
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm not sure.</font>

176
00:14:21.684 --> 00:14:25.017
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I'll admit.
I'm a little scared.</font>

177
00:14:25.083 --> 00:14:27.484
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're talking about
dangerous rituals.</font>

178
00:14:27.551 --> 00:14:29.550
<font color="#FFFFFF">thousands of years old.</font>

179
00:14:29.617 --> 00:14:31.150
<font color="#FFFFFF">There are going to
be repercussions.</font>

180
00:14:31.217 --> 00:14:34.050
<font color="#FFFFFF">So can somebody
just say one thing?</font>

181
00:14:34.117 --> 00:14:37.149
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are we doing this or not?</font>

182
00:14:37.216 --> 00:14:38.749
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. the message
was for you. Scott.</font>

183
00:14:38.816 --> 00:14:40.216
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's yours to answer.</font>

184
00:14:40.317 --> 00:14:41.397
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's more than a message.</font>

185
00:14:47.048 --> 00:14:49.981
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is the sword
that killed her.</font>

186
00:14:50.048 --> 00:14:52.316
<font color="#FFFFFF">Her blood</font>

187
00:14:52.382 --> 00:14:55.315
<font color="#FFFFFF">stained the blade.</font>

188
00:14:55.381 --> 00:14:57.615
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't been to Beacon Hills
in a long time.</font>

189
00:15:00.315 --> 00:15:03.047
<font color="#FFFFFF">None of us have.</font>

190
00:15:03.114 --> 00:15:05.714
<font color="#FFFFFF">But if you drive out tomorrow.
I can meet you there</font>

191
00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:08.580
<font color="#FFFFFF">by afternoon.</font>

192
00:15:08.647 --> 00:15:10.847
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're gonna need more help.</font>

193
00:15:10.914 --> 00:15:12.314
<font color="#FFFFFF">And more answers.</font>

194
00:15:15.079 --> 00:15:18.113
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. I'm gonna need to find
some old friends.</font>

195
00:15:20.513 --> 00:15:23.413
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sound energy...
I'm speaking specifically</font>

196
00:15:23.479 --> 00:15:26.045
<font color="#FFFFFF">of the sounds that fill
our acoustic environment.</font>

197
00:15:26.112 --> 00:15:28.212
<font color="#FFFFFF">Our current ability to harness
those sounds.</font>

198
00:15:28.313 --> 00:15:31.012
<font color="#FFFFFF">as not only
a renewable energy source.</font>

199
00:15:31.078 --> 00:15:33.977
<font color="#FFFFFF">but as a green sustainable
electric energy.</font>

200
00:15:34.044 --> 00:15:36.312
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lydia. I hate to
interrupt you. especially</font>

201
00:15:36.345 --> 00:15:38.877
<font color="#FFFFFF">since you're going full throttle
with this tech shit</font>

202
00:15:38.944 --> 00:15:40.387
<font color="#FFFFFF">that none of us really seem
to understand.</font>

203
00:15:40.411 --> 00:15:42.577
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thanks for the input. Rick.
and for not interrupting.</font>

204
00:15:42.644 --> 00:15:44.944
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Yeah. Lyd. listen...
