408
00:32:32.357 --> 00:32:33.590
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK. I wanted to.</font>

409
00:32:33.656 --> 00:32:35.224
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. that I can believe.</font>

410
00:32:36.656 --> 00:32:38.756
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Hi.
- Hi.</font>

411
00:32:42.523 --> 00:32:44.055
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's good to see you.</font>

412
00:32:44.122 --> 00:32:46.522
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's kind of awkward to see you.</font>

