419
00:33:14.386 --> 00:33:15.586
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you sure about that?</font>

420
00:33:15.653 --> 00:33:17.119
<font color="#FFFFFF">Positive.</font>

421
00:33:17.220 --> 00:33:19.719
<font color="#FFFFFF">How long has it been since
