428
00:33:38.318 --> 00:33:39.917
<font color="#FFFFFF">What would you light first?</font>

429
00:33:39.983 --> 00:33:41.117
<font color="#FFFFFF">The match.</font>

430
00:33:43.083 --> 00:33:45.617
<font color="#FFFFFF">You came all this way to
