433
00:33:50.949 --> 00:33:53.583
<font color="#FFFFFF">An egg.</font>

434
00:33:53.650 --> 00:33:56.217
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm tall when I'm young.</font>

435
00:33:56.283 --> 00:33:58.549
<font color="#FFFFFF">and I'm short when I'm old.</font>

436
00:33:58.616 --> 00:34:02.216
<font color="#FFFFFF">What am I?
A candle.</font>

437
00:34:02.249 --> 00:34:04.482
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you want to talk
about that bullet.</font>

438
00:34:04.549 --> 00:34:06.748
<font color="#FFFFFF">or you want to keep
