440
00:34:08.681 --> 00:34:11.214
<font color="#FFFFFF">All of them.</font>

441
00:34:11.215 --> 00:34:12.615
<font color="#FFFFFF">What has many keys...</font>

442
00:34:12.681 --> 00:34:14.548
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stop.</font>

443
00:34:14.615 --> 00:34:16.281
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stop talking.</font>

444
00:34:16.348 --> 00:34:19.714
<font color="#FFFFFF">What has many keys
