445
00:34:19.780 --> 00:34:21.047
<font color="#FFFFFF">A piano.</font>

446
00:34:21.114 --> 00:34:22.980
<font color="#FFFFFF">What has many teeth
but cannot bite?</font>

447
00:34:23.047 --> 00:34:24.680
<font color="#FFFFFF">A comb.</font>

448
00:34:29.347 --> 00:34:31.613
<font color="#FFFFFF">What is always in front of you
