449
00:34:31.679 --> 00:34:34.079
<font color="#FFFFFF">The future.</font>

450
00:34:34.213 --> 00:34:36.613
<font color="#FFFFFF">The more of this there is.
the less you can see.</font>

451
00:34:36.679 --> 00:34:39.678
<font color="#FFFFFF">What is it?</font>

452
00:34:39.745 --> 00:34:42.213
<font color="#FFFFFF">Darkness. you motherfucker!</font>

453
00:35:06.476 --> 00:35:07.543
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's me.</font>

454
00:35:07.610 --> 00:35:09.210
<font color="#FFFFFF">Um. hey. we're still looking.</font>

455
00:35:09.276 --> 00:35:13.109
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just getting a little worried
