469
00:35:57.339 --> 00:35:58.572
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh.</font>

470
00:35:58.639 --> 00:36:00.572
<font color="#FFFFFF">It is you.</font>

471
00:36:00.639 --> 00:36:02.905
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli. Derek's son.</font>

472
00:36:02.971 --> 00:36:04.438
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wow. you've gotten really big.</font>

473
00:36:04.505 --> 00:36:06.047
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. It's probably
