474
00:36:06.071 --> 00:36:07.671
<font color="#FFFFFF">the last time you saw me.</font>

475
00:36:07.738 --> 00:36:09.271
<font color="#FFFFFF">What are you doing out here?</font>

476
00:36:09.338 --> 00:36:11.347
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was kind of wondering what
