480
00:36:15.104 --> 00:36:16.437
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know what you're looking for.</font>

481
00:36:16.504 --> 00:36:17.737
<font color="#FFFFFF">The tree. right?</font>

482
00:36:17.804 --> 00:36:19.180
<font color="#FFFFFF">That huge stump's that's
