484
00:36:20.903 --> 00:36:22.404
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kind of.</font>

485
00:36:22.470 --> 00:36:23.604
<font color="#FFFFFF">I sleepwalk.</font>

486
00:36:23.669 --> 00:36:25.036
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know why.</font>

487
00:36:25.103 --> 00:36:26.779
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I've just been doing it
