491
00:36:32.536 --> 00:36:33.703
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. all of 'em.</font>

492
00:36:33.769 --> 00:36:35.603
<font color="#FFFFFF">What about the tree?</font>

493
00:36:35.668 --> 00:36:36.868
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not far from here.</font>

494
00:36:36.935 --> 00:36:38.078
<font color="#FFFFFF">I knew we were going
