495
00:36:38.102 --> 00:36:39.245
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. you were going
the wrong way.</font>

496
00:36:39.269 --> 00:36:41.035
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's that way.
We were circling back.</font>

497
00:36:41.102 --> 00:36:42.635
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Hm.
- Thank you.</font>

498
00:36:42.702 --> 00:36:43.744
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. I can help you find it.</font>

499
00:36:43.768 --> 00:36:45.767
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Got it.
