500
00:36:52.467 --> 00:36:54.501
<font color="#FFFFFF">What are you doing?</font>

501
00:37:00.733 --> 00:37:03.366
<font color="#FFFFFF">So aren't you the screamer?</font>

502
00:37:03.433 --> 00:37:04.700
<font color="#FFFFFF">Banshee.</font>

503
00:37:04.766 --> 00:37:06.233
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. but banshees scream.
