507
00:37:12.965 --> 00:37:14.999
<font color="#FFFFFF">that could crush your skull.</font>

508
00:37:15.065 --> 00:37:17.399
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good to know.</font>

509
00:37:17.465 --> 00:37:19.798
<font color="#FFFFFF">There it is.</font>

510
00:37:19.864 --> 00:37:22.232
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK. OK.</font>

511
00:37:23.898 --> 00:37:25.232
<font color="#FFFFFF">So what should we do
about Argent?</font>

512
00:37:25.299 --> 00:37:28.664
<font color="#FFFFFF">Uh. I mean. I'm never
gonna get a signal now.</font>

513
00:37:28.731 --> 00:37:30.006
