00:37:32.863 --> 00:37:34.097
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's his daughter.</font>

517
00:37:34.198 --> 00:37:35.897
<font color="#FFFFFF">You said it has to be tonight.</font>

518
00:37:35.963 --> 00:37:37.897
<font color="#FFFFFF">He would want us to do this
