519
00:37:40.630 --> 00:37:42.263
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't you have something to do?</font>

520
00:37:42.330 --> 00:37:43.397
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah.</font>

521
00:37:43.463 --> 00:37:44.903
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. I have a lacrosse game
to play.</font>

522
00:37:44.962 --> 00:37:46.406
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. more like a lacrosse
game to show up to</font>

523
00:37:46.430 --> 00:37:49.197
<font color="#FFFFFF">since I. like.
I never get to play.</font>

524
00:37:51.829 --> 00:37:53.329
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh! You want me to leave?</font>

525
00:37:53.396 --> 00:37:55.496
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK. Uh. I got it.</font>

526
00:37:55.562 --> 00:37:57.429
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK. well. I'll tell my dad
