527
00:37:57.496 --> 00:37:59.495
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. don't.</font>

528
00:37:59.561 --> 00:38:00.661
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't tell him anything.</font>

529
00:38:00.728 --> 00:38:04.094
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is kind of...
Personal.</font>

530
00:38:04.195 --> 00:38:05.695
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right. Don't worry.</font>

531
00:38:05.761 --> 00:38:07.827
<font color="#FFFFFF">I won't say anything.</font>

532
00:38:18.694 --> 00:38:19.726
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right.</font>

533
00:38:19.793 --> 00:38:21.394
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now what?</font>

534
00:38:23.893 --> 00:38:25.559
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK.</font>

535
00:38:29.825 --> 00:38:32.692
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why are you looking at me?</font>

536
00:38:32.758 --> 00:38:34.326
<font color="#FFFFFF">I didn't write the instructions.</font>

537
00:38:34.392 --> 00:38:35.725
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. you did.</font>

538
00:38:35.792 --> 00:38:37.232
<font color="#FFFFFF">You literally wrote
