539
00:38:37.292 --> 00:38:39.024
<font color="#FFFFFF">Okay. you know what I mean.</font>

540
00:38:47.557 --> 00:38:48.824
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you feel that?</font>

541
00:38:48.891 --> 00:38:50.557
