558
00:41:20.644 --> 00:41:22.344
<font color="#FFFFFF">I got a question.</font>

559
00:41:22.411 --> 00:41:24.444
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do we do when she wakes up?</font>

560
00:41:24.511 --> 00:41:26.178
