566
00:41:48.575 --> 00:41:50.808
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just get her inside.</font>

567
00:41:50.875 --> 00:41:52.541
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK.</font>

568
00:42:37.537 --> 00:42:41.804
<font color="#FFFFFF">Chaos!</font>

569
00:42:41.871 --> 00:42:45.903
