571
00:42:54.536 --> 00:42:55.636
<font color="#FFFFFF">Listen up!</font>

572
00:42:55.702 --> 00:42:59.069
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tonight's game
is not just a game.</font>

573
00:42:59.170 --> 00:43:01.435
<font color="#FFFFFF">This is a preamble
to what comes tomorrow.</font>

574
00:43:01.502 --> 00:43:06.535
