575
00:43:06.602 --> 00:43:09.235
<font color="#FFFFFF">This tournament
is everything I've dreamed of</font>

576
00:43:09.302 --> 00:43:11.169
<font color="#FFFFFF">my entire career
as a lacrosse coach.</font>

577
00:43:11.202 --> 00:43:13.801
<font color="#FFFFFF">And that trophy is
going right here. boys.</font>

578
00:43:13.868 --> 00:43:16.801
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I know none of you
will ruin it for me</font>

579
00:43:16.867 --> 00:43:19.167
<font color="#FFFFFF">by losing this game tonight!</font>

580
00:43:19.168 --> 00:43:20.234
<font color="#FFFFFF">Am I right?</font>

581
00:43:20.301 --> 00:43:22.700
<font color="#FFFFFF">All: Yes. Coach!</font>

582
00:43:22.767 --> 00:43:23.833
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh.</font>

583
00:43:23.900 --> 00:43:24.900
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's just you.</font>

584
00:43:24.967 --> 00:43:26.733
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just me.</font>

585
00:43:26.800 --> 00:43:28.667
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I'm here. with him.</font>

586
00:43:32.832 --> 00:43:34.233
<font color="#FFFFFF">We can talk about it later.</font>

587
00:43:34.300 --> 00:43:35.466
<font color="#FFFFFF">I came to watch you play.</font>

588
00:43:35.532 --> 00:43:36.808
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. prepare for
