593
00:43:48.398 --> 00:43:51.897
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli.
you probably got the feeling</font>

594
00:43:51.964 --> 00:43:54.298
<font color="#FFFFFF">that I'm not actually here
to watch your game.</font>

595
00:43:54.365 --> 00:43:56.530
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah?
Kinda.</font>

596
00:43:56.597 --> 00:44:00.264
<font color="#FFFFFF">And that maybe I'm here to
give my good friend. your dad.</font>

597
00:44:00.330 --> 00:44:02.397
<font color="#FFFFFF">just a little support as
he deals with</font>

598
00:44:02.464 --> 00:44:05.164
<font color="#FFFFFF">his somewhat delinquent son.</font>

599
00:44:05.197 --> 00:44:06.197
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe.</font>

600
00:44:06.230 --> 00:44:07.829
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I'm not.</font>

601
00:44:07.896 --> 00:44:08.996
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm here to warn you.</font>

602
00:44:09.063 --> 00:44:10.263
<font color="#FFFFFF">You steal that Jeep again.</font>

603
00:44:10.329 --> 00:44:12.196
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to haul your ass
