606
00:44:15.828 --> 00:44:18.229
<font color="#FFFFFF">for a minimum of 90 days.</font>

607
00:44:20.163 --> 00:44:22.228
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did he tell you to scare me?</font>

608
00:44:23.162 --> 00:44:24.528
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe.</font>

609
00:44:24.595 --> 00:44:26.462
<font color="#FFFFFF">Good luck with the game. Eli.</font>

610
00:44:26.528 --> 00:44:27.827
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah.</font>

611
00:44:34.694 --> 00:44:36.303
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you think about my son
getting a little playing time</font>

