01:14:29.638 --> 01:14:31.006
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't heal. I can't transform.</font>

1026
01:14:31.039 --> 01:14:32.172
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't do any of it.</font>

1027
01:14:32.239 --> 01:14:34.039
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. you're gonna learn
right now.</font>

1028
01:14:35.171 --> 01:14:36.338
<font color="#FFFFFF">How?</font>

1029
01:14:36.405 --> 01:14:38.238
<font color="#FFFFFF">Like this.</font>

1030
01:14:58.469 --> 01:15:01.303
<font color="#FFFFFF">We've got multiple calls
about a fire.</font>

1031
01:15:01.369 --> 01:15:03.002
<font color="#FFFFFF">Copy. Dispatch.
We're en route now.</font>

1032
01:15:03.003 --> 01:15:06.502
<font color="#FFFFFF">Parrish. go to two.</font>

1033
01:15:06.568 --> 01:15:08.502
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll hit the station.</font>

1034
01:15:08.568 --> 01:15:10.003
<font color="#FFFFFF">But. Sheriff.</font>

1035
01:15:10.036 --> 01:15:12.901
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mason. he just... he vanished.</font>

1036
01:15:13.002 --> 01:15:15.302
<font color="#FFFFFF">We don't know
what happened to him yet.</font>

1037
01:15:15.368 --> 01:15:17.901
<font color="#FFFFFF">Right now.
I need you at the station.</font>

1038
01:15:18.002 --> 01:15:19.035
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll check Hale Auto.</font>

1039
01:15:19.102 --> 01:15:21.334
<font color="#FFFFFF">You copy me?</font>

1040
01:15:21.401 --> 01:15:23.001
<font color="#FFFFFF">Copy. sir.</font>

1041
01:15:27.067 --> 01:15:30.101
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on. Eli! Don't stop!
She's right behind us.</font>

1042
01:15:31.833 --> 01:15:33.833
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on. keep going.</font>

1043
01:15:33.900 --> 01:15:35.009
<font color="#FFFFFF">Kid. come on. get up. get up!</font>

1044
01:15:35.033 --> 01:15:38.366
<font color="#FFFFFF">Go. go. go! Right there. go!</font>

1045
01:15:42.399 --> 01:15:45.033
<font color="#FFFFFF">Listen. you're gonna have to
keep going on without me.</font>

1046
01:15:45.099 --> 01:15:46.308
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wait. what are you
talking about?</font>

1047
01:15:46.332 --> 01:15:47.641
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have to try to
get through to her.</font>

1048
01:15:47.665 --> 01:15:50.499
<font color="#FFFFFF">She's trying to get
an arrow through you.</font>

1049
01:15:55.564 --> 01:15:57.364
<font color="#FFFFFF">What is that?</font>

1050
01:15:57.431 --> 01:15:59.098
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wolfsbane.</font>

1051
01:15:59.164 --> 01:16:00.897
<font color="#FFFFFF">She coated the arrowheads
in wolfsbane.</font>

1052
01:16:00.998 --> 01:16:02.839
<font color="#FFFFFF">My dad told me you almost
had to cut his arm off once</font>

1053
01:16:02.863 --> 01:16:04.897
<font color="#FFFFFF">because of wolfsbane poisoning.</font>

1054
01:16:04.998 --> 01:16:06.363
<font color="#FFFFFF">You need to run. Eli.</font>

1055
01:16:06.430 --> 01:16:08.506
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're not far from the road.
I... I'll keep her busy.</font>

1056
01:16:08.530 --> 01:16:11.829
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't. OK?
I can't do it without you.</font>

1057
01:16:11.896 --> 01:16:14.197
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey. you're gonna be
all right. OK?</font>

1058
01:16:14.263 --> 01:16:15.572
<font color="#FFFFFF">Remember. you just learned
how to heal.</font>

1059
01:16:15.596 --> 01:16:16.662
<font color="#FFFFFF">You did that for me.</font>

1060
01:16:16.729 --> 01:16:18.496
<font color="#FFFFFF">I gave you a push.</font>

1061
01:16:18.562 --> 01:16:21.329
<font color="#FFFFFF">And if Allison has any chance
of remembering who she is.</font>

1062
01:16:21.396 --> 01:16:23.861
<font color="#FFFFFF">she's gonna need the same push.</font>

1063
01:16:23.996 --> 01:16:25.162
<font color="#FFFFFF">Find your dad.</font>

1064
01:16:25.229 --> 01:16:26.504
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think I'm gonna need his help.</font>

1065
01:16:26.528 --> 01:16:28.996
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. OK.</font>

1066
01:16:33.295 --> 01:16:34.995
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. the fires all happened</font>

1067
01:16:35.061 --> 01:16:37.860
<font color="#FFFFFF">right after the jar
was taken from Japan.</font>

1068
01:16:37.995 --> 01:16:40.061
<font color="#FFFFFF">Liam. that's him.</font>

1069
01:16:40.128 --> 01:16:41.137
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's the guy
who stole the jar.</font>

1070
01:16:41.161 --> 01:16:43.060
<font color="#FFFFFF">the one who freed the Nogitsune.</font>

1071
01:16:43.127 --> 01:16:44.727
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's the one setting the fires.</font>

1072
01:16:44.794 --> 01:16:46.759
<font color="#FFFFFF">And not the Nogitsune?</font>

1073
01:16:46.826 --> 01:16:49.160
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why don't we catch him
and kill the Nogitsune?</font>

1074
01:16:49.227 --> 01:16:50.535
<font color="#FFFFFF">That sounds like
a pretty good plan to me.</font>

1075
01:16:50.559 --> 01:16:52.393
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. the Nogitsune's
not a person.</font>

1076
01:16:52.459 --> 01:16:56.359
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's an ancient power. so old
it's practically elemental.</font>

1077
01:16:56.426 --> 01:16:58.193
<font color="#FFFFFF">It might not be possible
to kill him.</font>

1078
01:16:58.259 --> 01:17:00.658
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. I'm willing
to give it a shot.</font>

1079
01:17:00.725 --> 01:17:03.392
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're wasting time.</font>

1080
01:17:03.458 --> 01:17:05.035
<font color="#FFFFFF">You guys can figure out
who's starting the fire.</font>

1081
01:17:05.059 --> 01:17:06.725
<font color="#FFFFFF">We need to find Scott.</font>

1082
01:17:25.623 --> 01:17:28.991
<font color="#FFFFFF">She drove this one.
smashed right into Derek's.</font>

1083
01:17:30.756 --> 01:17:32.090
<font color="#FFFFFF">You smell something else?</font>

1084
01:17:34.822 --> 01:17:36.990
<font color="#FFFFFF">Anger.</font>

1085
01:17:37.023 --> 01:17:39.322
<font color="#FFFFFF">The air. it's rife
with a homicidal rage.</font>

1086
01:17:39.389 --> 01:17:41.289
<font color="#FFFFFF">She certainly has the anger
of an Argent.</font>

1087
01:17:41.355 --> 01:17:44.089
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then it's more proof
it's not Allison.</font>

1088
01:17:44.155 --> 01:17:46.122
<font color="#FFFFFF">My daughter wouldn't kill
a 15-year-old boy.</font>

1089
01:17:46.189 --> 01:17:47.721
<font color="#FFFFFF">You had the Nogitsune
in your head.</font>

1090
01:17:47.788 --> 01:17:48.888
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe it's in hers.</font>

1091
01:17:48.989 --> 01:17:50.122
<font color="#FFFFFF">If there's room enough.</font>

1092
01:17:50.189 --> 01:17:51.988
<font color="#FFFFFF">with all of that
unadulterated fury.</font>

1093
01:17:51.989 --> 01:17:54.554
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not everybody has your anger.</font>

1094
01:17:54.621 --> 01:17:56.388
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not everyone has your optimism.</font>

1095
01:17:56.454 --> 01:17:58.454
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't underestimate anger.
Melissa.</font>

1096
01:17:58.520 --> 01:18:00.297
<font color="#FFFFFF">We all have the same instinct
for fight or flight.</font>

1097
01:18:00.321 --> 01:18:04.687
<font color="#FFFFFF">Flight begins with fear
but fight is born of anger.</font>

1098
01:18:04.753 --> 01:18:06.253
<font color="#FFFFFF">She put an arrow into his truck.</font>

1099
01:18:06.320 --> 01:18:09.353
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're on the run. that way.</font>

1100
01:18:09.420 --> 01:18:10.900
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can you track 'em
through the woods?</font>

1101
01:18:10.987 --> 01:18:12.419
<font color="#FFFFFF">Both: Yes.</font>

1102
01:18:20.685 --> 01:18:22.419
<font color="#FFFFFF">Allison. stop!</font>

1103
01:18:37.985 --> 01:18:40.084
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want to talk.</font>

1104
01:18:41.017 --> 01:18:42.650
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sure. let's talk.</font>

1105
01:18:46.084 --> 01:18:47.616
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad? Dad?</font>

1106
01:18:47.683 --> 01:18:48.883
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli?</font>

1107
01:18:48.984 --> 01:18:50.383
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli!</font>

1108
01:18:53.583 --> 01:18:54.782
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're safe. Eli.</font>

1109
01:18:54.848 --> 01:18:56.283
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're safe.</font>

1110
01:18:56.349 --> 01:18:57.882
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. but Scott isn't.</font>

1111
01:18:57.983 --> 01:19:00.049
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey. we got a problem.</font>

1112
01:19:01.848 --> 01:19:03.115
<font color="#FFFFFF">Three of them.</font>

1113
01:19:18.481 --> 01:19:20.480
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was done by a sword.</font>

1114
01:20:13.942 --> 01:20:15.276
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hikari!</font>

1115
01:20:57.538 --> 01:20:58.738
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad!</font>

1116
01:21:16.403 --> 01:21:18.570
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. no!</font>

1117
01:21:21.103 --> 01:21:22.470
<font color="#FFFFFF">Deaton!</font>

1118
01:21:37.002 --> 01:21:38.035
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad...</font>

1119
01:21:47.534 --> 01:21:49.700
<font color="#FFFFFF">Remember who you are.</font>

1120
01:21:58.067 --> 01:22:01.233
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Malia?
- Come on. Come on!</font>

1121
01:22:13.698 --> 01:22:15.431
<font color="#FFFFFF">Allison. if you just
give me one second.</font>

1122
01:22:15.498 --> 01:22:17.665
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can tell you the truth.
You killed half my family.</font>

1123
01:22:17.731 --> 01:22:20.531
<font color="#FFFFFF">I never killed anyone.
and neither did you.</font>

1124
01:22:25.564 --> 01:22:28.830
<font color="#FFFFFF">I know those daggers
have wolfsbane on them.</font>

1125
01:22:28.965 --> 01:22:31.045
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I know you think you're
gonna go through with it.</font>

1126
01:22:34.430 --> 01:22:36.230
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because that's what
the Nogitsune wants.</font>

1127
01:22:36.297 --> 01:22:39.963
<font color="#FFFFFF">He wants me to die
in your arms this time.</font>

1128
01:22:39.964 --> 01:22:41.963
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you ready for that?</font>

1129
01:22:42.029 --> 01:22:43.996
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because it's not easy.</font>

1130
01:22:44.529 --> 01:22:47.229
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on.</font>

1131
01:22:54.628 --> 01:22:56.995
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli. what are you doing?</font>

1132
01:22:57.062 --> 01:22:58.962
<font color="#FFFFFF">- I can do this.
- Oh. shit!</font>

1133
01:23:01.294 --> 01:23:02.962
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!</font>

1134
01:23:19.093 --> 01:23:20.792
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli.</font>

1135
01:23:25.359 --> 01:23:26.825
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoa. OK. stop!</font>

1136
01:23:26.960 --> 01:23:29.425
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's it gonna take to
get you to stop and listen?</font>

1137
01:23:54.990 --> 01:23:57.157
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK. you killed me.</font>

1138
01:23:57.223 --> 01:23:58.856
<font color="#FFFFFF">Now can we talk?</font>

1139
01:23:58.957 --> 01:24:01.822
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why is the guy who went to
Japan to free the Nogitsune</font>

1140
01:24:01.957 --> 01:24:03.798
<font color="#FFFFFF">now in Beacon Hills trying
to burn down the woods?</font>

1141
01:24:03.822 --> 01:24:05.198
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's not trying to
burn down the woods.</font>

1142
01:24:05.222 --> 01:24:08.755
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's... only part of it.</font>

1143
01:24:08.821 --> 01:24:10.621
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do we have to play
junior detectives?</font>

1144
01:24:10.688 --> 01:24:12.989
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can't we just leave it up
to the actual detectives?</font>

1145
01:24:13.056 --> 01:24:15.388
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you see any actual
detectives standing around?</font>

1146
01:24:18.787 --> 01:24:21.520
<font color="#FFFFFF">But what do detectives do.
anyway?</font>

1147
01:24:21.587 --> 01:24:24.154
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do they. like. go to
the scene of the crime and...</font>

1148
01:24:24.220 --> 01:24:26.487
<font color="#FFFFFF">detect something?</font>

1149
01:24:28.520 --> 01:24:30.819
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's exactly what they do.</font>

1150
01:24:30.954 --> 01:24:33.220
<font color="#FFFFFF">We need to look at
one of the burn sites.</font>

1151
01:24:33.287 --> 01:24:35.219
<font color="#FFFFFF">the first one.</font>

1152
01:24:35.286 --> 01:24:36.819
<font color="#FFFFFF">Guys. guys.</font>

1153
01:24:36.954 --> 01:24:38.286
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hi.</font>

1154
01:24:38.353 --> 01:24:40.019
<font color="#FFFFFF">We got a big-ass problem.</font>

1155
01:24:40.086 --> 01:24:43.485
<font color="#FFFFFF">Derek. Stilinski. Eli. Deaton.
they're all gone.</font>

1156
01:24:43.552 --> 01:24:44.552
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you mean gone?</font>

1157
01:24:44.618 --> 01:24:46.086
<font color="#FFFFFF">They were taken.</font>

1158
01:24:46.153 --> 01:24:47.752
<font color="#FFFFFF">By who?</font>

1159
01:24:48.818 --> 01:24:50.452
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Oni.</font>

1160
01:25:00.384 --> 01:25:03.284
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's blood...</font>

1161
01:25:03.351 --> 01:25:05.850
<font color="#FFFFFF">all around here. and a lot.</font>

1162
01:25:05.951 --> 01:25:07.951
<font color="#FFFFFF">If she managed to cut him
with her ring dagger</font>

1163
01:25:08.017 --> 01:25:09.616
<font color="#FFFFFF">then he's in trouble.</font>

1164
01:25:09.683 --> 01:25:11.183
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're laced with wolfsbane.</font>

1165
01:25:11.250 --> 01:25:12.616
<font color="#FFFFFF">How long does he have?</font>

1166
01:25:12.683 --> 01:25:15.116
<font color="#FFFFFF">Six. eight hours at most.</font>

1167
01:25:23.749 --> 01:25:25.615
<font color="#FFFFFF">These rapid burns...</font>

1168
01:25:29.748 --> 01:25:32.648
<font color="#FFFFFF">There is something
systematic about it.</font>

1169
01:25:32.714 --> 01:25:34.314
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is she gonna keep
talking like this?</font>

1170
01:25:34.381 --> 01:25:37.048
<font color="#FFFFFF">I stopped listening
six hours ago.</font>

1171
01:25:37.114 --> 01:25:38.581
<font color="#FFFFFF">All right. I'm sorry.</font>

1172
01:25:38.647 --> 01:25:39.656
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm not gonna spend
the rest of the day</font>

1173
01:25:39.680 --> 01:25:40.613
<font color="#FFFFFF">walking through the woods.</font>

1174
01:25:40.680 --> 01:25:42.347
<font color="#FFFFFF">trying to catch a pyromaniac.</font>

1175
01:25:42.413 --> 01:25:43.813
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you have a better plan?</font>

1176
01:25:43.948 --> 01:25:45.847
<font color="#FFFFFF">We already know
what kills the Oni.</font>

1177
01:25:45.948 --> 01:25:47.480
<font color="#FFFFFF">Silver.</font>

1178
01:25:47.547 --> 01:25:48.846
<font color="#FFFFFF">You with me?</font>

1179
01:25:48.947 --> 01:25:50.580
<font color="#FFFFFF">Go.
Get all the silver you can.</font>

1180
01:25:50.646 --> 01:25:52.746
<font color="#FFFFFF">And if you find the Oni.
don't fight them. kill them.</font>

1181
01:26:10.745 --> 01:26:13.045
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're heading back to
the main road. aren't we?</font>

1182
01:26:15.744 --> 01:26:19.577
<font color="#FFFFFF">And my blood.
it's going to lure them.</font>

1183
01:26:19.644 --> 01:26:21.777
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm the bait for
the trap. right?</font>

1184
01:26:24.044 --> 01:26:27.709
<font color="#FFFFFF">'Cause by the time the others
catch up to us. I'll be dead.</font>

1185
01:26:27.776 --> 01:26:29.186
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you can pick the others
off one by one.</font>

1186
01:26:29.210 --> 01:26:31.443
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is that the plan?</font>

1187
01:26:31.509 --> 01:26:33.209
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. actually.
That is the plan.</font>

1188
01:26:35.708 --> 01:26:37.775
<font color="#FFFFFF">You don't hunt werewolves.
Allison.</font>

1189
01:26:37.842 --> 01:26:40.243
<font color="#FFFFFF">And no matter what the Nogitsune
put into your head.</font>

1190
01:26:40.308 --> 01:26:42.342
<font color="#FFFFFF">you don't kill them either.</font>

1191
01:26:42.408 --> 01:26:43.775
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I think part of you
knows it.</font>

1192
01:26:43.842 --> 01:26:45.975
<font color="#FFFFFF">I saw it the moment
you stabbed me.</font>

1193
01:26:46.042 --> 01:26:48.774
<font color="#FFFFFF">Saw what?</font>

1194
01:26:48.841 --> 01:26:49.942
<font color="#FFFFFF">Regret.</font>

1195
01:26:53.008 --> 01:26:55.507
<font color="#FFFFFF">Go.</font>

1196
01:26:58.806 --> 01:27:02.506
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jackson. what do you smell?</font>

1197
01:27:02.573 --> 01:27:04.473
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ugh. The horrifying
stench of death.</font>

1198
01:27:04.540 --> 01:27:06.640
<font color="#FFFFFF">What else do you smell?</font>

1199
01:27:11.073 --> 01:27:13.073
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not gas.</font>

1200
01:27:13.140 --> 01:27:16.040
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's not lighter fluid
or anything like that.</font>

1201
01:27:16.106 --> 01:27:17.639
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's different.</font>

1202
01:27:17.705 --> 01:27:20.272
<font color="#FFFFFF">Chemical accelerant.</font>

1203
01:27:20.339 --> 01:27:21.939
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mm-hmm. It's a quick burn</font>

1204
01:27:22.005 --> 01:27:24.571
<font color="#FFFFFF">so they can't set
the rest of the forest on fire.</font>

1205
01:27:24.638 --> 01:27:26.972
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. does that tell us
anything useful?</font>

1206
01:27:27.039 --> 01:27:31.104
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. in terms of the fire.
they know chemicals.</font>

1207
01:27:34.471 --> 01:27:36.503
<font color="#FFFFFF">They know exactly
how to use them.</font>

1208
01:27:36.570 --> 01:27:38.204
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't get it.
Why would someone</font>

1209
01:27:38.271 --> 01:27:41.637
<font color="#FFFFFF">spend all this time and energy
burning up rowan trees?</font>

1210
01:27:41.703 --> 01:27:43.170
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Rowan trees?
- Yeah.</font>

1211
01:27:43.237 --> 01:27:44.936
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's what the smell is. right?</font>

1212
01:27:44.937 --> 01:27:46.279
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jackson. do you know
what rowan trees become</font>

1213
01:27:46.303 --> 01:27:47.502
<font color="#FFFFFF">after they're burned?</font>

1214
01:27:47.569 --> 01:27:49.702
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ash?</font>

1215
01:27:53.336 --> 01:27:55.236
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mountain ash.</font>

1216
01:28:01.936 --> 01:28:04.801
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're not gonna kill me.</font>

1217
01:28:04.936 --> 01:28:09.135
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's right. The wolfsbane is
going to kill you.</font>

1218
01:28:09.201 --> 01:28:10.600
<font color="#FFFFFF">You had a code.</font>

1219
01:28:10.667 --> 01:28:11.968
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mm-hmm.</font>

1220
01:28:12.035 --> 01:28:13.334
<font color="#FFFFFF">"We hunt those who hunt us."</font>

1221
01:28:13.400 --> 01:28:16.634
<font color="#FFFFFF">No.</font>

1222
01:28:16.700 --> 01:28:19.567
<font color="#FFFFFF">You came up with a new one.</font>

1223
01:28:19.634 --> 01:28:23.766
<font color="#FFFFFF">"We protect..."
"We protect those who...</font>

1224
01:28:23.833 --> 01:28:26.499
<font color="#FFFFFF">cannot protect themselves."</font>

1225
01:28:26.566 --> 01:28:28.666
<font color="#FFFFFF">You remember.</font>

1226
01:28:43.932 --> 01:28:46.165
<font color="#FFFFFF">We should grab whatever we can.</font>

1227
01:28:51.531 --> 01:28:53.597
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm taking this.</font>

1228
01:28:57.097 --> 01:28:58.396
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't worry.
It's not the look.</font>

1229
01:28:58.463 --> 01:29:00.230
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's more of a...</font>

1230
01:29:00.296 --> 01:29:03.130
<font color="#FFFFFF">"you look really hot holding
a tactical tomahawk" look.</font>

1231
01:29:10.595 --> 01:29:14.095
<font color="#FFFFFF">If we don't die tonight.
we can talk about it.</font>

1232
01:29:14.162 --> 01:29:15.329
<font color="#FFFFFF">Huh.</font>

1233
01:29:15.395 --> 01:29:18.029
<font color="#FFFFFF">Then I'm definitely not
dying tonight.</font>

1234
01:29:43.327 --> 01:29:46.459
<font color="#FFFFFF">Scott.</font>

1235
01:29:46.526 --> 01:29:48.059
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes. he's handsome.</font>

1236
01:29:48.126 --> 01:29:50.759
<font color="#FFFFFF">History is replete
with handsome killers.</font>

1237
01:29:50.825 --> 01:29:52.426
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's still a killer.</font>

1238
01:29:52.492 --> 01:29:53.725
<font color="#FFFFFF">What am I even doing here?</font>

1239
01:29:53.791 --> 01:29:56.391
<font color="#FFFFFF">This... this can't be
the right thing to do.</font>

1240
01:29:56.458 --> 01:29:59.291
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't get lost in useless
moral quandaries. Allison.</font>

1241
01:29:59.358 --> 01:30:00.925
<font color="#FFFFFF">Stick to the plan.</font>

1242
01:30:00.991 --> 01:30:02.991
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your father is on his way here
right now.</font>

1243
01:30:03.058 --> 01:30:05.291
<font color="#FFFFFF">I saw him at the hospital.
That was him.</font>

1244
01:30:05.358 --> 01:30:09.891
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. he's on his way and
he's bringing Peter Hale.</font>

1245
01:30:09.958 --> 01:30:11.925
<font color="#FFFFFF">You remember what
that monster did to Kate?</font>

1246
01:30:11.990 --> 01:30:14.823
<font color="#FFFFFF">He ripped her throat out
with his claws.</font>

1247
01:30:14.890 --> 01:30:17.190
<font color="#FFFFFF">He'll do the same to you
if he gets the chance.</font>

1248
01:30:17.257 --> 01:30:19.689
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't you remember
how they burned us?</font>

1249
01:30:19.756 --> 01:30:22.156
<font color="#FFFFFF">We lost years.</font>

1250
01:30:22.223 --> 01:30:27.855
<font color="#FFFFFF">Can't you feel that life
stolen from you?</font>

1251
01:30:27.923 --> 01:30:29.323
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know what I feel!</font>

1252
01:30:29.389 --> 01:30:31.223
<font color="#FFFFFF">A few more hours
and the sun goes down.</font>

1253
01:30:31.288 --> 01:30:33.422
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'll take care
of everything then.</font>

1254
01:30:33.488 --> 01:30:35.822
<font color="#FFFFFF">They come out at night.</font>

1255
01:30:35.889 --> 01:30:38.955
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Who?
- The Oni.</font>

1256
01:30:39.022 --> 01:30:43.687
<font color="#FFFFFF">And with them comes chaos.</font>

1257
01:30:52.087 --> 01:30:54.254
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli.</font>

1258
01:30:54.320 --> 01:30:56.286
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli. can you hear me?</font>

1259
01:31:14.285 --> 01:31:15.784
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're not dead.</font>

1260
01:31:15.919 --> 01:31:18.318
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not yet.</font>

1261
01:31:20.384 --> 01:31:21.384
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where are we?</font>

1262
01:31:21.451 --> 01:31:23.718
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's just an illusion.</font>

1263
01:31:37.917 --> 01:31:40.083
<font color="#FFFFFF">What about them?</font>

1264
01:32:03.248 --> 01:32:05.948
<font color="#FFFFFF">If we don't come up with a way
to get this wolfsbane out soon.</font>

1265
01:32:06.015 --> 01:32:09.614
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm going to die.</font>

1266
01:32:09.680 --> 01:32:11.547
<font color="#FFFFFF">We need to find Liam.</font>

1267
01:32:11.613 --> 01:32:12.914
<font color="#FFFFFF">Your beta?</font>

1268
01:32:12.980 --> 01:32:15.546
<font color="#FFFFFF">My friend.</font>

1269
01:32:15.613 --> 01:32:17.313
<font color="#FFFFFF">Liam and Hikari.</font>

1270
01:32:17.379 --> 01:32:19.079
<font color="#FFFFFF">She's a kitsune.</font>

1271
01:32:19.146 --> 01:32:21.946
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why that arrow
didn't do anything to her.</font>

1272
01:32:22.013 --> 01:32:23.812
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because of the fox.</font>

1273
01:32:23.913 --> 01:32:26.013
<font color="#FFFFFF">It protects her. like armor.</font>

1274
01:32:26.079 --> 01:32:28.512
<font color="#FFFFFF">It won't protect her
from the Oni.</font>

1275
01:32:28.578 --> 01:32:30.245
<font color="#FFFFFF">Nothing protected you either.</font>

1276
01:32:32.912 --> 01:32:35.178
<font color="#FFFFFF">- What do you mean?
- You died in my arms.</font>

1277
01:32:37.978 --> 01:32:41.077
<font color="#FFFFFF">And if you let me.
I could prove it to you.</font>

1278
01:32:43.344 --> 01:32:45.411
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're lying.</font>

1279
01:32:45.477 --> 01:32:47.911
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just give me a chance.</font>

1280
01:32:50.211 --> 01:32:55.676
<font color="#FFFFFF">If you still
don't believe me. fine.</font>

1281
01:32:55.743 --> 01:32:57.910
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let me die.</font>

1282
01:32:59.043 --> 01:33:00.943
<font color="#FFFFFF">And what if I do?</font>

1283
01:33:01.010 --> 01:33:03.309
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. then you're gonna
have to save me.</font>

1284
01:33:07.575 --> 01:33:10.209
<font color="#FFFFFF">Derek. I'm not so sure
even your strength</font>

1285
01:33:10.275 --> 01:33:13.009
<font color="#FFFFFF">could break those bonds.
not here.</font>

1286
01:33:13.075 --> 01:33:14.308
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli. are you OK?</font>

1287
01:33:14.374 --> 01:33:15.909
<font color="#FFFFFF">How's your leg?</font>

1288
01:33:15.942 --> 01:33:17.441
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. it's fine.</font>

1289
01:33:17.508 --> 01:33:18.907
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's healed.</font>

1290
01:33:18.908 --> 01:33:19.974
<font color="#FFFFFF">You learn how to heal?</font>

1291
01:33:20.041 --> 01:33:21.041
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. kind of.</font>

1292
01:33:21.108 --> 01:33:22.573
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. Scott did most of it.</font>

1293
01:33:22.640 --> 01:33:24.707
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's amazing!</font>

1294
01:33:24.773 --> 01:33:26.207
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey. Derek.</font>

1295
01:33:26.273 --> 01:33:27.383
<font color="#FFFFFF">Maybe you want to be
a little more subtle</font>

1296
01:33:27.407 --> 01:33:30.107
<font color="#FFFFFF">with your antics.</font>

1297
01:33:30.173 --> 01:33:33.506
<font color="#FFFFFF">The Nogitsune isn't gonna
kill us. not yet.</font>

1298
01:33:33.572 --> 01:33:36.472
<font color="#FFFFFF">He put us here to watch him win.</font>

1299
01:33:36.539 --> 01:33:38.406
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're here for our pain.</font>

1300
01:33:43.106 --> 01:33:44.771
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you guys hear that?</font>

1301
01:33:49.571 --> 01:33:51.638
<font color="#FFFFFF">It sounds like...</font>

1302
01:33:51.705 --> 01:33:53.338
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lacrosse.</font>

1303
01:34:10.237 --> 01:34:11.903
<font color="#FFFFFF">At least we know
she hasn't caught him yet.</font>

1304
01:34:11.904 --> 01:34:14.069
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. she's caught him.</font>

1305
01:34:14.136 --> 01:34:16.469
<font color="#FFFFFF">Allison knows to retrieve
her arrows whenever she can.</font>

1306
01:34:16.536 --> 01:34:18.903
<font color="#FFFFFF">This was left so we're
following the right trail.</font>

1307
01:34:18.969 --> 01:34:20.502
<font color="#FFFFFF">Guys.</font>

1308
01:34:23.003 --> 01:34:25.168
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't think
we're following a trail.</font>

1309
01:34:25.235 --> 01:34:27.602
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're being led into a trap.
and I think that's it.</font>

1310
01:34:27.668 --> 01:34:28.902
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's the college stadium.</font>

1311
01:34:28.968 --> 01:34:31.035
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's where the lacrosse
tournament's being held.</font>

1312
01:34:31.102 --> 01:34:32.543
<font color="#FFFFFF">And while they play
a lacrosse game.</font>

1313
01:34:32.567 --> 01:34:36.434
<font color="#FFFFFF">we'll be playing right
into the Nogitsune's game.</font>

1314
01:34:36.501 --> 01:34:38.734
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's where he'll make
his final moves.</font>

1315
01:34:38.801 --> 01:34:40.900
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's just hope he hasn't
figured out a divine move.</font>

1316
01:34:40.901 --> 01:34:42.067
<font color="#FFFFFF">What's that?</font>

1317
01:34:42.134 --> 01:34:43.533
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a move in the game of Go.</font>

1318
01:34:43.600 --> 01:34:48.001
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a move so brilliant.
so inspired.</font>

1319
01:34:48.066 --> 01:34:49.576
<font color="#FFFFFF">that it changes the shape
of the entire game.</font>

1320
01:34:49.600 --> 01:34:53.533
<font color="#FFFFFF">A move that only a god
could make.</font>

1321
01:34:53.599 --> 01:34:55.100
<font color="#FFFFFF">Divine.</font>

1322
01:35:00.465 --> 01:35:02.699
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think the accelerant
used to start these fires</font>

1323
01:35:02.765 --> 01:35:05.965
<font color="#FFFFFF">might be the same one used to
start a fire over 20 years ago.</font>

1324
01:35:06.032 --> 01:35:08.664
<font color="#FFFFFF">Are you talking about the fire
that killed Derek's family?</font>

1325
01:35:08.731 --> 01:35:11.431
<font color="#FFFFFF">And there's one more thing.</font>

1326
01:35:11.498 --> 01:35:14.631
<font color="#FFFFFF">The person who came up with this
formula is supposed to be dead.</font>

1327
01:35:14.698 --> 01:35:16.240
<font color="#FFFFFF">"Supposed to be dead"
is starting to be</font>

1328
01:35:16.264 --> 01:35:17.898
<font color="#FFFFFF">a recurring theme around here.</font>

1329
01:35:42.495 --> 01:35:45.161
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just... hold on.</font>

1330
01:35:46.661 --> 01:35:48.528
<font color="#FFFFFF">Please.</font>

1331
01:35:58.060 --> 01:35:59.694
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's my license.</font>

1332
01:36:07.994 --> 01:36:10.593
<font color="#FFFFFF">It was at the ice rink.</font>

1333
01:36:10.659 --> 01:36:11.902
<font color="#FFFFFF">The other pictures
didn't come out</font>

1334
01:36:11.926 --> 01:36:14.758
<font color="#FFFFFF">so I tore that one off for you.</font>

1335
01:36:14.893 --> 01:36:16.725
<font color="#FFFFFF">After you died.</font>

1336
01:36:16.792 --> 01:36:20.026
<font color="#FFFFFF">your father gave that to me.</font>

1337
01:36:23.025 --> 01:36:25.791
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lydia was there.</font>

1338
01:36:25.892 --> 01:36:27.392
<font color="#FFFFFF">And Stiles.</font>

1339
01:36:29.724 --> 01:36:32.257
<font color="#FFFFFF">Remember the winter formal?</font>

1340
01:36:34.957 --> 01:36:36.891
<font color="#FFFFFF">I went with my friends.</font>

1341
01:36:36.957 --> 01:36:40.024
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jackson and Lydia.</font>

1342
01:36:40.091 --> 01:36:42.756
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't remember anybody else.</font>

1343
01:36:42.891 --> 01:36:44.690
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was there.</font>

1344
01:36:46.590 --> 01:36:50.522
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I found you inside.
and we danced.</font>

1345
01:36:54.090 --> 01:36:56.389
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't remember any of that.</font>

1346
01:36:58.555 --> 01:37:00.555
<font color="#FFFFFF">We kissed.</font>

1347
01:37:03.155 --> 01:37:06.188
<font color="#FFFFFF">And that was the first time
I told you that I loved you.</font>

1348
01:37:09.388 --> 01:37:11.653
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why did you do that?</font>

1349
01:37:12.154 --> 01:37:14.188
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because I love you.</font>

1350
01:37:15.487 --> 01:37:16.687
<font color="#FFFFFF">When you broke up with me.</font>

1351
01:37:16.753 --> 01:37:21.752
<font color="#FFFFFF">I said I knew we were
gonna be together.</font>

1352
01:37:21.887 --> 01:37:25.053
<font color="#FFFFFF">And you told me...</font>

1353
01:37:25.120 --> 01:37:27.552
<font color="#FFFFFF">"There's no such thing as fate."</font>

1354
01:37:31.386 --> 01:37:34.419
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you remember what
I told you back?</font>

1355
01:37:40.585 --> 01:37:42.518
<font color="#FFFFFF">"There's no such thing
as a werewolf."</font>

1356
01:37:48.018 --> 01:37:49.517
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tell me the rest.</font>

1357
01:37:49.584 --> 01:37:52.784
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can't. because I'm going
to die if you don't help me.</font>

1358
01:37:52.885 --> 01:37:55.084
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do I have to do?</font>

1359
01:37:55.150 --> 01:37:58.050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wolfsbane only responds to fire.</font>

1360
01:37:58.117 --> 01:38:01.683
<font color="#FFFFFF">You've got to burn it out.</font>

1361
01:38:03.884 --> 01:38:10.183
<font color="#FFFFFF">A man looks at a photograph
of another man.</font>

1362
01:38:10.249 --> 01:38:15.148
<font color="#FFFFFF">He says. "Brothers and sisters
have I none.</font>

1363
01:38:15.215 --> 01:38:21.581
<font color="#FFFFFF">But this man's father
is my father's son."</font>

1364
01:38:25.481 --> 01:38:28.147
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who is the man
in the photograph?</font>

1365
01:38:28.214 --> 01:38:29.614
<font color="#FFFFFF">My son.</font>

1366
01:38:29.681 --> 01:38:31.247
<font color="#FFFFFF">Ah.</font>

1367
01:38:36.147 --> 01:38:37.881
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't be afraid.</font>

1368
01:38:37.914 --> 01:38:40.613
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. of this guy? No. no way.</font>

1369
01:38:40.680 --> 01:38:44.313
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. my God. he's touching me.</font>

1370
01:38:44.380 --> 01:38:48.213
<font color="#FFFFFF">The son of Derek Hale.</font>

1371
01:38:48.279 --> 01:38:53.679
<font color="#FFFFFF">But not a wolf yet. is he?</font>

1372
01:38:53.745 --> 01:38:56.212
<font color="#FFFFFF">When night falls.</font>

1373
01:38:56.279 --> 01:39:00.644
<font color="#FFFFFF">he may earn his fangs.
his claws.</font>

1374
01:39:00.711 --> 01:39:03.078
<font color="#FFFFFF">watching the rest of you die!</font>

1375
01:39:16.776 --> 01:39:18.310
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoa. uh...</font>

1376
01:39:18.377 --> 01:39:22.043
<font color="#FFFFFF">you couldn't find a lighter?</font>

1377
01:39:22.110 --> 01:39:24.943
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you want to live or not?</font>

1378
01:39:26.042 --> 01:39:28.076
<font color="#FFFFFF">Burn it out.</font>

1379
01:40:07.139 --> 01:40:08.738
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli. did you see that?</font>

1380
01:40:08.805 --> 01:40:10.305
<font color="#FFFFFF">Did you see your eyes?</font>

1381
01:40:10.372 --> 01:40:11.448
<font color="#FFFFFF">How the hell am I supposed
to see my eyes?</font>

1382
01:40:11.472 --> 01:40:12.648
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're the things I use to see.</font>

1383
01:40:12.672 --> 01:40:14.838
<font color="#FFFFFF">- They were glowing.
- What?</font>

1384
01:40:14.905 --> 01:40:16.038
<font color="#FFFFFF">They were?
Yes.</font>

1385
01:40:20.005 --> 01:40:21.337
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh.</font>

1386
01:40:21.404 --> 01:40:23.037
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wait. don't!</font>

1387
01:40:24.171 --> 01:40:27.837
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tell me. Eli.</font>

1388
01:40:27.904 --> 01:40:29.470
<font color="#FFFFFF">do you like riddles?</font>

1389
01:40:29.536 --> 01:40:30.847
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm more of a limerick
kind of guy.</font>

1390
01:40:30.871 --> 01:40:33.370
<font color="#FFFFFF">You know. I like the rhyming.</font>

1391
01:40:34.736 --> 01:40:37.736
<font color="#FFFFFF">Finstock. thanks for
reminding everyone here</font>

1392
01:40:37.802 --> 01:40:40.735
<font color="#FFFFFF">that no team chokes
quite like Beacon Hills.</font>

1393
01:40:40.802 --> 01:40:41.903
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're still up. Hogan.</font>

1394
01:40:43.602 --> 01:40:44.602
<font color="#FFFFFF">Shit!</font>

1395
01:40:50.235 --> 01:40:51.402
<font color="#FFFFFF">I need to find my father.</font>

1396
01:40:51.469 --> 01:40:53.601
<font color="#FFFFFF">If he's here.
he's in danger too.</font>

1397
01:40:55.002 --> 01:40:58.368
<font color="#FFFFFF">Allison. wait.</font>

1398
01:40:58.434 --> 01:41:02.733
<font color="#FFFFFF">Look. this isn't
just about us anymore.</font>

1399
01:41:03.567 --> 01:41:05.968
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think I remember you.</font>

1400
01:41:06.034 --> 01:41:07.500
<font color="#FFFFFF">or maybe someone like you.</font>

1401
01:41:07.567 --> 01:41:09.300
<font color="#FFFFFF">maybe someone
I was in love with.</font>

1402
01:41:09.367 --> 01:41:12.367
<font color="#FFFFFF">And maybe...
Maybe if I had more time.</font>

1403
01:41:12.433 --> 01:41:13.867
<font color="#FFFFFF">I would remember everything.</font>

1404
01:41:13.933 --> 01:41:16.699
<font color="#FFFFFF">But I can't help you right now.
I have to find my father.</font>

1405
01:41:16.766 --> 01:41:19.967
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think he might be
the only one I have left.</font>

1406
01:41:20.033 --> 01:41:21.499
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah.</font>

1407
01:41:31.099 --> 01:41:36.631
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's put one of the players
back in the game.</font>

1408
01:41:36.697 --> 01:41:38.865
<font color="#FFFFFF">No!</font>

1409
01:41:57.429 --> 01:42:00.628
<font color="#FFFFFF">Allison.
Hey! Allison. Allison.</font>

1410
01:42:00.695 --> 01:42:02.129
<font color="#FFFFFF">They don't know that it's you.</font>

1411
01:42:02.196 --> 01:42:04.096
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not even your own father.</font>

1412
01:42:04.163 --> 01:42:06.728
<font color="#FFFFFF">So just...</font>

1413
01:42:06.863 --> 01:42:09.395
<font color="#FFFFFF">be careful.</font>

1414
01:42:09.462 --> 01:42:11.228
<font color="#FFFFFF">I just tried to kill you.</font>

1415
01:42:11.295 --> 01:42:14.627
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you're telling me
to be careful.</font>

1416
01:42:14.694 --> 01:42:16.327
<font color="#FFFFFF">Why would you do that?</font>

1417
01:42:20.327 --> 01:42:23.294
<font color="#FFFFFF">Because I'm still in love
with you.</font>

1418
01:42:37.392 --> 01:42:38.625
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli!</font>

1419
01:42:38.692 --> 01:42:40.860
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where the hell
did you come from?</font>

1420
01:42:40.926 --> 01:42:42.159
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get off the... hey!</font>

1421
01:42:42.225 --> 01:42:43.759
<font color="#FFFFFF">Off the field!</font>

1422
01:42:43.859 --> 01:42:46.624
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get off the field! Look at you!</font>

1423
01:42:46.691 --> 01:42:47.859
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli?</font>

1424
01:42:52.458 --> 01:42:54.859
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's happening now.</font>

1425
01:42:54.891 --> 01:42:57.324
<font color="#FFFFFF">The mountain ash is more
than a barrier.</font>

1426
01:42:57.391 --> 01:42:59.158
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's a gateway between
his world and ours.</font>

1427
01:42:59.224 --> 01:43:02.323
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. I really hate when you
say shit like that.</font>

1428
01:43:02.390 --> 01:43:04.557
<font color="#FFFFFF">Isn't it just ash?</font>

1429
01:43:08.590 --> 01:43:10.522
<font color="#FFFFFF">Parrish has to break
the barrier.</font>

1430
01:43:10.589 --> 01:43:11.990
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's the only one
that can do it.</font>

1431
01:43:14.190 --> 01:43:16.289
<font color="#FFFFFF">Jackson.</font>

1432
01:43:16.857 --> 01:43:19.556
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK. so it's a place.
but it's not real.</font>

1433
01:43:19.622 --> 01:43:21.022
<font color="#FFFFFF">They're all there with my dad.</font>

1434
01:43:21.089 --> 01:43:22.989
<font color="#FFFFFF">and they're alive.
This part of the game?</font>

1435
01:43:23.056 --> 01:43:24.597
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's like he's knocking
pieces off the board.</font>

1436
01:43:24.621 --> 01:43:25.989
<font color="#FFFFFF">So how come he put me
back on it?</font>

1437
01:43:26.056 --> 01:43:27.197
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know. but I need to
get you out of here.</font>

1438
01:43:27.221 --> 01:43:28.621
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on.</font>

1439
01:43:28.688 --> 01:43:31.555
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh! What the hell was that?</font>

1440
01:43:31.621 --> 01:43:33.488
<font color="#FFFFFF">Mountain ash.</font>

1441
01:43:43.854 --> 01:43:45.519
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's him.</font>

1442
01:43:45.586 --> 01:43:46.887
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's really him.</font>

1443
01:43:46.954 --> 01:43:48.853
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's him who?</font>

1444
01:43:48.854 --> 01:43:50.853
<font color="#FFFFFF">Adrian Harris.</font>

1445
01:43:50.854 --> 01:43:52.686
<font color="#FFFFFF">He kind of looks like
our chemistry teacher.</font>

1446
01:43:52.753 --> 01:43:54.919
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was your chemistry teacher.
Jackson.</font>

1447
01:43:54.986 --> 01:43:56.153
<font color="#FFFFFF">you fucking imbecile.</font>

1448
01:43:57.886 --> 01:44:01.418
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do it. Scream. Lydia.
Scream like a banshee.</font>

1449
01:44:01.485 --> 01:44:02.618
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. Oh. that's right.</font>

1450
01:44:02.685 --> 01:44:05.352
<font color="#FFFFFF">You haven't screamed in years.
have you?</font>

1451
01:44:05.418 --> 01:44:06.352
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you want from us?</font>

1452
01:44:06.418 --> 01:44:08.452
<font color="#FFFFFF">Well. I don't want an apology.</font>

1453
01:44:08.517 --> 01:44:09.885
<font color="#FFFFFF">seeing as how
you ruined my life.</font>

1454
01:44:09.952 --> 01:44:11.684
<font color="#FFFFFF">and you served me up
as a human sacrifice</font>

1455
01:44:11.751 --> 01:44:12.952
<font color="#FFFFFF">to some demented druid.</font>

1456
01:44:13.018 --> 01:44:15.217
<font color="#FFFFFF">I was in London for all of that.</font>

1457
01:44:19.851 --> 01:44:21.450
<font color="#FFFFFF">The sun's going down.</font>

1458
01:44:21.516 --> 01:44:22.692
<font color="#FFFFFF">If the Oni come out at night...</font>

1459
01:44:22.716 --> 01:44:24.650
<font color="#FFFFFF">There's 10.000 people
in this stadium.</font>

1460
01:44:24.716 --> 01:44:26.016
<font color="#FFFFFF">What are we supposed to do?</font>

1461
01:44:26.083 --> 01:44:27.450
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on.</font>

1462
01:44:27.516 --> 01:44:28.716
<font color="#FFFFFF">Hey. Coach?</font>

1463
01:44:28.850 --> 01:44:29.883
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Come on.
- Coach!</font>

1464
01:44:29.950 --> 01:44:31.050
<font color="#FFFFFF">Coach. hey!</font>

1465
01:44:31.116 --> 01:44:32.183
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. no. no. no. no.</font>

1466
01:44:32.250 --> 01:44:33.382
<font color="#FFFFFF">Unacceptable.</font>

1467
01:44:33.449 --> 01:44:34.682
<font color="#FFFFFF">You graduated. McCall.</font>

1468
01:44:34.749 --> 01:44:36.249
<font color="#FFFFFF">You're not ruining this for me.</font>

1469
01:44:36.315 --> 01:44:39.149
<font color="#FFFFFF">Coach. every single person
in this stadium is in danger.</font>

1470
01:44:39.215 --> 01:44:41.091
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is there any way to get them out
without panicking them?</font>

1471
01:44:41.115 --> 01:44:42.449
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yeah. you win the game.</font>

1472
01:44:42.515 --> 01:44:44.082
<font color="#FFFFFF">What happens if they tie it up?</font>

1473
01:44:44.149 --> 01:44:45.015
<font color="#FFFFFF">Sudden death.</font>

1474
01:44:45.082 --> 01:44:46.314
<font color="#FFFFFF">Coach.</font>

1475
01:44:46.381 --> 01:44:47.821
<font color="#FFFFFF">there's gonna be
10.000 sudden deaths</font>

1476
01:44:47.849 --> 01:44:49.882
<font color="#FFFFFF">if we don't stop this game.</font>

1477
01:44:55.148 --> 01:44:56.281
<font color="#FFFFFF">Crap!</font>

1478
01:44:56.347 --> 01:44:57.589
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't felt this level
of disappointment</font>

1479
01:44:57.613 --> 01:44:59.147
<font color="#FFFFFF">since I lost my virginity.</font>

1480
01:44:59.213 --> 01:45:00.747
<font color="#FFFFFF">You want to help us win. McCall?</font>

1481
01:45:04.047 --> 01:45:05.947
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here.</font>

1482
01:45:12.880 --> 01:45:16.845
<font color="#FFFFFF">Four minutes.
whoever scores first wins.</font>

1483
01:45:16.846 --> 01:45:19.279
<font color="#FFFFFF">Number 11?
That used to be my number.</font>

1484
01:45:19.346 --> 01:45:20.411
<font color="#FFFFFF">Do you want it back?</font>

1485
01:45:20.478 --> 01:45:22.178
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. no. That's OK.</font>

1486
01:45:22.245 --> 01:45:23.621
<font color="#FFFFFF">Just. if you're gonna wear
my number. you better score.</font>

1487
01:45:23.645 --> 01:45:24.845
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'll try.</font>

1488
01:45:24.846 --> 01:45:26.378
<font color="#FFFFFF">Let's go! Let's do it!</font>

1489
01:45:26.445 --> 01:45:28.278
<font color="#FFFFFF">Asses on the field!</font>

1490
01:45:28.345 --> 01:45:31.111
<font color="#FFFFFF">We score first!</font>

1491
01:45:33.945 --> 01:45:36.410
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come take a look. Lydia.</font>

1492
01:45:37.677 --> 01:45:38.953
<font color="#FFFFFF">This was no small
accomplishment.</font>

1493
01:45:38.977 --> 01:45:40.877
<font color="#FFFFFF">This illusion has
several layers.</font>

1494
01:45:40.944 --> 01:45:43.509
<font color="#FFFFFF">Here. Lydia.
let me show you one.</font>

1495
01:45:43.576 --> 01:45:44.853
<font color="#FFFFFF">You want me to watch
a lacrosse game?</font>

1496
01:45:44.877 --> 01:45:46.376
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. no.</font>

1497
01:45:46.443 --> 01:45:48.876
<font color="#FFFFFF">I want you to watch
your friends die.</font>

1498
01:45:48.943 --> 01:45:50.409
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on.</font>

1499
01:45:50.476 --> 01:45:51.836
<font color="#FFFFFF">Take a look through
the microscope.</font>

1500
01:46:01.741 --> 01:46:03.208
<font color="#FFFFFF">You didn't change.</font>

1501
01:46:05.108 --> 01:46:06.108
<font color="#FFFFFF">What?</font>

1502
01:46:06.175 --> 01:46:07.241
<font color="#FFFFFF">When they took Eli.</font>

1503
01:46:07.307 --> 01:46:09.141
<font color="#FFFFFF">you didn't change.</font>

1504
01:46:09.207 --> 01:46:13.307
<font color="#FFFFFF">He means you didn't transform
in front of your son.</font>

1505
01:46:13.374 --> 01:46:14.740
<font color="#FFFFFF">I haven't.</font>

1506
01:46:14.841 --> 01:46:18.573
<font color="#FFFFFF">He hasn't seen me like that.</font>

1507
01:46:18.640 --> 01:46:20.606
<font color="#FFFFFF">Not since the first time.</font>

1508
01:46:20.673 --> 01:46:22.973
<font color="#FFFFFF">OK. what was the first time?</font>

1509
01:46:23.040 --> 01:46:26.539
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know
if he'd even remembers.</font>

1510
01:46:26.605 --> 01:46:28.672
<font color="#FFFFFF">He might have been too young.</font>

1511
01:46:28.739 --> 01:46:30.019
<font color="#FFFFFF">Coyotes had come into the house.</font>

1512
01:46:30.073 --> 01:46:32.639
<font color="#FFFFFF">They clawed through
the screen door.</font>

1513
01:46:32.705 --> 01:46:34.072
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli was playing on the floor.</font>

1514
01:46:34.139 --> 01:46:37.738
<font color="#FFFFFF">and they were heading
straight for him.</font>

1515
01:46:37.839 --> 01:46:41.571
<font color="#FFFFFF">I transformed instantly.</font>

1516
01:46:41.638 --> 01:46:44.704
<font color="#FFFFFF">Roared so loud it shook
the entire house.</font>

1517
01:46:44.839 --> 01:46:49.304
<font color="#FFFFFF">Coyotes took off
and there was Eli.</font>

1518
01:46:49.371 --> 01:46:51.138
<font color="#FFFFFF">looking up at me.</font>

1519
01:46:53.871 --> 01:46:56.203
<font color="#FFFFFF">He was shaking.
He was...</font>

1520
01:46:56.270 --> 01:47:00.037
<font color="#FFFFFF">He was terrified.</font>

1521
01:47:00.103 --> 01:47:05.170
<font color="#FFFFFF">And he wouldn't let me
come near him for days.</font>

1522
01:47:05.236 --> 01:47:08.702
<font color="#FFFFFF">That look of fear in his eyes
when he saw me.</font>

1523
01:47:08.837 --> 01:47:10.902
<font color="#FFFFFF">I couldn't get it
out of my head.</font>

1524
01:47:10.969 --> 01:47:14.069
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's why he can't change.</font>

1525
01:47:14.136 --> 01:47:17.869
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think every time
he starts to. or...</font>

1526
01:47:17.936 --> 01:47:21.834
<font color="#FFFFFF">maybe every time he tries.</font>

1527
01:47:21.835 --> 01:47:25.268
<font color="#FFFFFF">he must see my face...</font>

1528
01:47:25.335 --> 01:47:27.267
<font color="#FFFFFF">snarling back at him.</font>

1529
01:47:36.599 --> 01:47:38.366
<font color="#FFFFFF">Get it to McCall! To McCall!</font>

1530
01:47:38.433 --> 01:47:40.967
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes! Yes! Yes!</font>

1531
01:47:47.199 --> 01:47:48.899
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoa. Sh...</font>

1532
01:47:53.665 --> 01:47:56.298
<font color="#FFFFFF">I knew the Nogitsune
was too chaotic</font>

1533
01:47:56.365 --> 01:47:58.432
<font color="#FFFFFF">to play this game on his own.</font>

1534
01:47:58.498 --> 01:48:01.298
<font color="#FFFFFF">He needed me to help him win.</font>

1535
01:48:01.364 --> 01:48:03.164
<font color="#FFFFFF">All I had to do was
give him my pain.</font>

1536
01:48:03.231 --> 01:48:05.464
<font color="#FFFFFF">Thanks to you and Scott McCall.</font>

1537
01:48:05.531 --> 01:48:06.631
<font color="#FFFFFF">I have plenty.</font>

1538
01:48:06.697 --> 01:48:09.164
<font color="#FFFFFF">We all have pain.</font>

1539
01:48:09.231 --> 01:48:12.031
<font color="#FFFFFF">But Lydia's pain is
particularly appealing</font>

1540
01:48:12.097 --> 01:48:13.530
<font color="#FFFFFF">to a thousand-year-old demon.</font>

1541
01:48:13.596 --> 01:48:15.430
<font color="#FFFFFF">My pain isn't anything to him.</font>

1542
01:48:15.496 --> 01:48:19.096
<font color="#FFFFFF">On the contrary. heartbreak
is a veritable delicacy</font>

1543
01:48:19.163 --> 01:48:20.063
<font color="#FFFFFF">to the Nogitsune.</font>

1544
01:48:20.130 --> 01:48:22.830
<font color="#FFFFFF">So give him a taste. Lydia.</font>

1545
01:48:22.863 --> 01:48:24.896
<font color="#FFFFFF">Tell us why you left Stiles.</font>

1546
01:48:24.963 --> 01:48:26.362
<font color="#FFFFFF">Give us your pain.</font>

1547
01:48:26.429 --> 01:48:29.495
<font color="#FFFFFF">or the next time.
I shoot Jackson in the head.</font>

1548
01:48:29.562 --> 01:48:30.929
<font color="#FFFFFF">No. Lydia.</font>

1549
01:48:30.995 --> 01:48:32.495
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lydia. don't do it.</font>

1550
01:48:32.562 --> 01:48:34.329
<font color="#FFFFFF">Don't do it!</font>

1551
01:48:34.395 --> 01:48:37.328
<font color="#FFFFFF">I left.</font>

1552
01:48:37.394 --> 01:48:38.628
<font color="#FFFFFF">I left because of a dream.</font>

1553
01:48:38.694 --> 01:48:40.594
<font color="#FFFFFF">What happened in the dream?</font>

1554
01:48:40.661 --> 01:48:42.161
<font color="#FFFFFF">My eyes open...</font>

1555
01:48:45.461 --> 01:48:47.828
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I see broken glass.</font>

1556
01:48:50.928 --> 01:48:53.060
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's from a windshield.</font>

1557
01:48:55.560 --> 01:48:58.993
<font color="#FFFFFF">And I'm crawling
on the pavement.</font>

1558
01:49:00.993 --> 01:49:03.860
<font color="#FFFFFF">I'm trying to reach Stiles.</font>

1559
01:49:06.459 --> 01:49:09.326
<font color="#FFFFFF">There was a crash.</font>

1560
01:49:10.725 --> 01:49:14.058
<font color="#FFFFFF">We'd been thrown from the car.</font>

1561
01:49:17.025 --> 01:49:20.325
<font color="#FFFFFF">Except he's not moving.</font>

1562
01:49:21.557 --> 01:49:24.825
<font color="#FFFFFF">He wasn't blinking.</font>

1563
01:49:24.858 --> 01:49:25.858
<font color="#FFFFFF">He wasn't breathing.</font>

1564
01:49:25.891 --> 01:49:28.824
<font color="#FFFFFF">Lydia. it was just a dream.</font>

1565
01:49:28.890 --> 01:49:31.656
<font color="#FFFFFF">Until it happened again.</font>

1566
01:49:31.723 --> 01:49:35.556
<font color="#FFFFFF">And again.</font>

1567
01:49:35.623 --> 01:49:38.956
<font color="#FFFFFF">Becomes this recurring dream</font>

1568
01:49:39.023 --> 01:49:41.023
<font color="#FFFFFF">until I can't tell anymore
that if it's a dream...</font>

1569
01:49:41.089 --> 01:49:42.423
<font color="#FFFFFF">Or a premonition.</font>

1570
01:49:43.923 --> 01:49:45.722
<font color="#FFFFFF">If I was never in
the car with him.</font>

1571
01:49:45.823 --> 01:49:49.856
<font color="#FFFFFF">there wouldn't have to be
a crash.</font>

1572
01:49:49.922 --> 01:49:51.988
<font color="#FFFFFF">And he wouldn't have to die.</font>

1573
01:49:52.055 --> 01:49:54.422
<font color="#FFFFFF">And you wouldn't have to scream.</font>

1574
01:49:54.488 --> 01:49:57.955
<font color="#FFFFFF">Banshees don't scream.</font>

1575
01:49:59.822 --> 01:50:03.087
<font color="#FFFFFF">They wail.</font>

1576
01:50:09.221 --> 01:50:10.320
<font color="#FFFFFF">New plan.</font>

1577
01:50:10.386 --> 01:50:11.629
<font color="#FFFFFF">You take the shot.
I'll cover you.</font>

1578
01:50:11.653 --> 01:50:13.162
<font color="#FFFFFF">- Are you kidding?
- No. it's your shot!</font>

1579
01:50:13.186 --> 01:50:14.186
<font color="#FFFFFF">Come on.</font>

1580
01:50:14.220 --> 01:50:15.820
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where did this kid come from?</font>

1581
01:50:15.886 --> 01:50:18.153
<font color="#FFFFFF">Is he even in high school?</font>

1582
01:50:18.220 --> 01:50:19.552
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's one of my best students.</font>

1583
01:50:19.619 --> 01:50:20.820
<font color="#FFFFFF">He looks like he's 30.</font>

1584
01:50:20.886 --> 01:50:22.319
<font color="#FFFFFF">Who the hell is that?</font>

1585
01:50:23.752 --> 01:50:24.952
<font color="#FFFFFF">That's Greenberg.</font>

1586
01:50:26.819 --> 01:50:28.885
<font color="#FFFFFF">What do you hear?</font>

1587
01:50:28.952 --> 01:50:30.985
<font color="#FFFFFF">It's like the game's happening
right next to us.</font>

1588
01:50:31.052 --> 01:50:32.852
<font color="#FFFFFF">I can hear it too.</font>

1589
01:50:32.919 --> 01:50:34.384
<font color="#FFFFFF">I think my son's on the field.</font>

1590
01:50:35.951 --> 01:50:37.784
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes! Take it!</font>

1591
01:50:37.851 --> 01:50:40.284
<font color="#FFFFFF">Eli. take it to the rack!</font>

1592
01:50:48.417 --> 01:50:51.083
<font color="#FFFFFF">Whoo!</font>

1593
01:50:51.150 --> 01:50:52.417
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes!</font>

1594
01:50:52.649 --> 01:50:53.783
<font color="#FFFFFF">Yes!</font>

1595
01:50:55.649 --> 01:50:57.249
<font color="#FFFFFF">Holy shit!</font>

1596
01:50:57.316 --> 01:50:58.956
<font color="#FFFFFF">Scott. did you see that?
Did you me score?</font>

1597
01:50:59.016 --> 01:51:01.149
<font color="#FFFFFF">My dad was actually right.
I'm actually pretty good.</font>

1598
01:51:03.816 --> 01:51:05.815
<font color="#FFFFFF">Oh. my God. my dad.</font>

1599
01:51:05.816 --> 01:51:07.182
<font color="#FFFFFF">This isn't over.</font>

1600
01:51:07.248 --> 01:51:09.315
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're gonna find the others.
Come on.</font>

1601
01:51:09.381 --> 01:51:11.415
<font color="#FFFFFF">Peter! Wait!</font>

1602
01:51:11.481 --> 01:51:12.848
<font color="#FFFFFF">No! No!</font>

1603
01:51:12.915 --> 01:51:14.048
<font color="#FFFFFF">No more illusions.</font>

1604
01:51:14.115 --> 01:51:16.647
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where's Scott? Where's my son?</font>

1605
01:51:16.714 --> 01:51:17.981
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's on the field.</font>

1606
01:51:18.048 --> 01:51:19.680
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's trying to save everyone.</font>

1607
01:51:19.815 --> 01:51:21.114
<font color="#FFFFFF">He's playing the game.</font>

1608
01:51:21.180 --> 01:51:23.014
<font color="#FFFFFF">That most definitely
sounds like your son.</font>

1609
01:51:23.080 --> 01:51:24.447
<font color="#FFFFFF">But as for your daughter...</font>

1610
01:51:24.514 --> 01:51:26.414
<font color="#FFFFFF">I forgot to tell you
something. Peter.</font>

1611
01:51:26.480 --> 01:51:28.679
<font color="#FFFFFF">The arrow wasn't the only thing
Allison left behind.</font>

1612
01:51:37.946 --> 01:51:39.512
<font color="#FFFFFF">Wolfsbane.</font>

1613
01:51:47.312 --> 01:51:50.412
<font color="#FFFFFF">You think I wouldn't recognize
my own daughter?</font>

1614
01:51:50.477 --> 01:51:52.311
<font color="#FFFFFF">It is you.</font>

1615
01:51:52.377 --> 01:51:53.912
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know.</font>

1616
01:51:53.978 --> 01:51:55.978
<font color="#FFFFFF">I don't know who or what I am.</font>

1617
01:51:56.044 --> 01:51:57.620
<font color="#FFFFFF">But my friends are in trouble
and it's all my fault.</font>

1618
01:51:57.644 --> 01:51:59.011
<font color="#FFFFFF">No.</font>

1619
01:52:02.676 --> 01:52:04.576
<font color="#FFFFFF">Dad. what's that?</font>

1620
01:52:10.876 --> 01:52:13.343
<font color="#FFFFFF">Allison?</font>

1621
01:52:19.876 --> 01:52:22.842
<font color="#FFFFFF">The real tournament begins.</font>

1622
01:52:26.708 --> 01:52:28.641
<font color="#FFFFFF">Where are we?</font>

1623
01:52:28.708 --> 01:52:30.608
<font color="#FFFFFF">We're in his world.</font>

